Your new app to read and study the Holy Bible

With this app you can:
- Quickly access both old and new testaments;
- Choose among several versions of the Bible
- Share verses right from your smartphone;
- Save your favorites verses for further reading;
- Choose four different font sizes;
- Do a quick chapter navigation through horizontal swipe;
- Do text or voice search;
- Nightly mode;
- No ads.

Help us to keep the job done. Our mission is give unreached people the opportunity to read the Bible in theirs mother language:
